            </connector>
            <label>Yes, this is an Interco Invoice</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>10/04/2026 - SP - Introducing entry conditions to exclude Invoices where the &quot;Opportunity Entity&quot; is either &quot;Probo-UK&quot; or &quot;Probo-SAS&quot;. As these were automatically genereated in USD, we had team members sending invoices in incorrect currencies.</description>
